                                "example_id": "9e87bdef-0169-49e9-acea-28f7a95ebabb",
                                "sense_id": "98114998-8521-3555-a5b7-68d065d33d76",
                                "text": "[…] Amazonians like David Risher, who lead^([sic]) the first expansion into retail in the 1990s; Warren Jenson, Covey's short-lived successor as CFO; and Rick Dalzell, the former Army Ranger who was Amazon's CIO for a decade."
                            },
